ws333 p027, test only (kbuild.sh applies it for the build and takes it off after): RC_CONTROL with the hardware's
own RC6 entry (HW_ENABLE bit 31 and EI_MODE(1) bit 27 beside RC6_ENABLE), the value a driver writes when no GuC
controls RC6, instead of RC6_ENABLE alone (the GuC's value, under which the hardware timers never enter RC6).
